---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ToolCard from '../components/ToolCard.astro';
import Bundles from '../components/Bundles.astro';
import Posts from '../components/Posts.astro';
import tools from '../data/tools.json';
import {getPosts} from '../lib/rss';
const feed=await getPosts();
const featured=['live-play-call-tracker','five-player-lineup-simulator','recruit-evaluation-dashboard'].map(s=>tools.find(t=>t.slug===s)!);
---
<Base hero><section class="hero" aria-label="Basketball analytics tools"><img class="hero-image" src="/images/courtside.webp" width="1280" height="720" alt="An illustrated basketball court with a coach studying his laptop on a courtside bench" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-content"><span class="eyebrow" id="hero-eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> Basketball analytics tools</span><h1>Know which plays<br/>actually score.</h1><p class="hero-sub" id="hero-sub">Game-day trackers, scouting templates and custom apps, built by a D1 video coordinator.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" id="hero-primary" href="/tools/">Browse the tools <Icon name="diagonal" size={17}/></a><a class="text-link" href="/custom-apps/">Request a custom app <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><p>For the work before the whistle.<br/>And the decisions after it.</p><a class="scroll-note" href="#intro"><span>Explore the playbook</span><Icon name="arrow" size={19}/></a><p class="hero-location eyebrow">Built courtside.<br/>Lubbock, Texas.</p></div></section>
<div class="credentials"><span class="eyebrow">A coach's perspective. An analyst's eye.</span><span>Video Coordinator, Texas Tech Women’s Basketball</span><span>Synergy & Sportscode Content Partner</span></div>
<section class="section intro" id="intro"><div><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">The game behind the game</span><h2>Better questions.<br/>Better basketball.</h2></div><div class="intro-copy"><p id="pillar-intro">Film tells a story. Data helps you see it. I build tools and share ideas that turn both into decisions your staff can use.</p><div class="role-chooser" aria-label="Personalize for your role"><span>Find your starting five.</span><button data-role-choice="hc" aria-pressed="false">I coach</button><button data-role-choice="vc" aria-pressed="false">I run video</button><button data-role-choice="rc" aria-pressed="false">I recruit</button><button class="role-clear" data-role-choice="none">Clear</button></div></div></section>
<section class="section pillar-grid" aria-label="Three ways to get better"><article class="pillar"><div class="pillar-number eyebrow">01 <Icon name="court"/></div><h3>The tools.</h3><p>Trackers and templates for game day, scouting and recruiting. From $5.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/">Find your edge <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></article><article class="pillar"><div class="pillar-number eyebrow">02 <Icon name="book"/></div><h3>The thinking.</h3><p>Weekly breakdowns on shot quality, lineups and turnovers.</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Read the blog <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></article><article class="pillar"><div class="pillar-number eyebrow">03 <Icon name="code"/></div><h3>Your system.</h3><p>Need something built for your system? Tell me what you track.</p><a class="text-link" href="/custom-apps/">Let’s build it <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></article></section>
<section class="section tool-section" id="featured"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">01 / The coach's toolkit</span><h2>Less guesswork.<br/>More game plan.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/tools/">Explore all 9 tools <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div><div class="tool-grid" id="featured-tools">{featured.map((tool,index)=><ToolCard tool={tool} index={index}/>)}</div><div class="tool-section-note"><span>Built for the sideline, the film room, and everything in between.</span><span>One-time purchase · Checkout on Stan ↗</span></div></section>
<Bundles/>
<section class="custom-band"><div class="court-watermark" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="section custom-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">03 / Your workflow. Your tool.</span><h2>Need a tool that<br/>doesn’t exist yet?</h2><p>The Live Play Call Tracker’s latest update came straight from coaches’ feedback after real games. Your workflow could be next.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/custom-apps/">Request a custom app <Icon name="diagonal" size={17}/></a></div><div class="process"><div><span>01</span><h3>Tell me what you track.</h3><p>Your workflow, the stats your staff cares about, and how you use them.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Build around your system.</h3><p>A tool shaped around your terminology, your staff, and your game.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Use it. Then refine it.</h3><p>Bring it to games and practices. Let real feedback guide what’s next.</p></div></div></div></section>
<Posts posts={feed.posts.slice(0,3)} cached={feed.cached}/>
<section class="about-teaser"><div class="section about-inner"><div class="about-emblem" aria-label="Jackson Davis monogram"><span class="initials">JD.</span><span class="eyebrow">A love for the game. A mind for the details.</span></div><div class="about-copy"><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">05 / Behind the clipboard</span><h2>Hi, I’m Jackson.</h2><p>I’m the Video Coordinator for Texas Tech Women’s Basketball and a Synergy & Sportscode content partner. I build tools that turn film and data into coaching decisions.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">A little more about me <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section quote-section"><Icon name="ball" size={30}/><blockquote>“Playing basketball without analytics is like driving without a GPS.”</blockquote><cite><a href="https://x.com/HudlHoops/status/2116176398486213032">Jackson Davis, as featured by Hudl Hoops ↗</a></cite></section>
</Base>
